<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>TraceXplorer AHK信号脚本批量生成器（完全离线版）</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            background-color: #f5f7fa;
        }
        .drop-area {
            border: 3px dashed #6688dd;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #444;
            background: #fff;
            transition: 0.25s;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .drop-area.hover {
            background-color: #e8f0ff;
            border-color: #2255cc;
        }
        textarea {
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 320px;
            font-family: Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: 13px;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 6px;
            white-space: pre;
        }
        .block {
            background: white;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 16px 0;
        }
        h3 {
            margin-top:0;
            color:#223355;
        }
        button {
            padding:9px 18px;
            font-size:15px;
            cursor:pointer;
            background:#2255cc;
            color:white;
            border:none;
            border-radius:5px;
        }
        button:disabled {
            background:#a0b2dd;
            cursor:not-allowed;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h2>TraceXplorer AHK信号脚本生成器（完全离线版）</h2>
    <div class="drop-area" id="dropZone">
        📁 <strong>请将txt文件精准拖拽到当前虚线框内（不要拖页面空白）</strong><br>
        <small>txt内必须包含 signals := [ ... ] 完整代码块；重新拖拽清空旧列表</small>
    </div>

    <div class="block">
        <h3>加载文件列表</h3>
        <div id="fileList"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="block">
        <h3>预览生成后的AHK代码（展示第一个加载文件）</h3>
        <textarea id="previewCode" readonly placeholder="加载文件后在此预览"></textarea>
    </div>

    <div style="margin:16px 0;">
        <button id="btnDownload" disabled>开始导出文件</button>
    </div>

<script>
/*! JSZip v3.10.1 | MIT License | https://stuk.github.io/jszip */
